#: GeneralPage.cpp:49
msgid "Global Power Management Configuration"
msgstr "Systeemwiet Stroomkuntrullsysteem-Instellen"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:50
msgid "A global power management configurator for KDE Power Management System"
msgstr "En systeemwiet Instellprogramm för dat KDE-Stroomkuntrullsysteem"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:51
msgid "(c), 2010 Dario Freddi"
msgstr "© 2010 Dario Freddi"

#: GeneralPage.cpp:52
msgid ""
"From this module, you can configure the main Power Management daemon, assign "
"profiles to states, and do some advanced fine tuning on battery handling"
msgstr ""
"Binnen dit Moduul kannst Du den Hööft-Stroomkuntrulldämoon instellen, "
"Profilen towiesen un en poor verwiedert Batterie-Instellen utföhren."

